[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11040.23, "timestamp": "03:04:00", "text": "首发之际，我耐心地等待着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11044.15, "timestamp": "03:04:04", "text": "很多。是的。我觉得我可能出道不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11046.63, "timestamp": "03:04:06", "text": "除非在四个月内，否则"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11048.79, "timestamp": "03:04:08", "text": "奇迹发生了。我不认为那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11051.75, "timestamp": "03:04:11", "text": "会发生，但我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11055.03, "timestamp": "03:04:15", "text": "但我会继续努力。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11057.59, "timestamp": "03:04:17", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11061.11, "timestamp": "03:04:21", "text": "我知道这一切，你们很多人，呃，谁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11064.309, "timestamp": "03:04:24", "text": "真的很想支持我，会帮忙的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11066.87, "timestamp": "03:04:26", "text": "即使你能支持，你也支持不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11069.11, "timestamp": "03:04:29", "text": "一切都好。我只是想问问你是否"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11071.269, "timestamp": "03:04:31", "text": "可以看看我的直播，尤其是在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11073.99, "timestamp": "03:04:33", "text": "YouTube。我正在尝试通过以下方式盈利："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11076.87, "timestamp": "03:04:36", "text": "YouTube 或成为 YouTube 合作伙伴，所以我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11078.55, "timestamp": "03:04:38", "text": "至少可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11080.95, "timestamp": "03:04:40", "text": "给人们带来 Twitch 的体验"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11083.59, "timestamp": "03:04:43", "text": "像Jocknik一样在YouTube上看我的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11086.15, "timestamp": "03:04:46", "text": "emo什么的，我终于可以了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11089.19, "timestamp": "03:04:49", "text": "突袭我那些做 YouTuber 的朋友们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11092.07, "timestamp": "03:04:52", "text": "以及内容创作者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11095.75, "timestamp": "03:04:55", "text": "现在很多事情都是这样。是的，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11098.07, "timestamp": "03:04:58", "text": "这也是我今年的目标之一。"}]